0..73 Comment "// The rule reading refuses the laws of a category with families for now."
74..148 Comment "// It carries no index at a sort that the laws rewrite (Huang and Angiuli,"
149..209 Comment "// _Fat cell structures and generalized algebraic theories_,"
210..254 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.LICS.2026.58, § 1.1)."
255..257 Comment "//"
258..335 Comment "// The category laws rewrite substitutions, a type moves along a substitution"
336..412 Comment "// and comprehension takes a type. So every sort of the CwF is flexible, and"
413..463 Comment "// the rule reading carries none of their indices."
464..466 Comment "//"
467..542 Comment "// Without the indices two laws part where the sorting joins them. A law on"
543..615 Comment "// terms relates two sides whose sorts agree only modulo a law on types."
616..618 Comment "//"
619..634 Comment "// - see: #5016"
